\**{c=red:Note:}** You can only partake on one quest of this questline per Earth day. Other quests that are affected by this restriction are {q:Royal Painter Escort|Royal Painter Escort|Royal Painter Escort} and {q:Targeting the Captain|Targeting the Captain|Targeting the Captain}.
=2 Walkthrough
* Trade {n:Halshaob} 3 {@i:Imp. Brz. Piece|2184} {i:Imperial Bronze Pieces|Imperial Bronze Piece|2184}.
** You are only allowed to do this quest once every 24 hours.
* Head to the Cutter, located in the {z:Arrapago Reef}.
** To get there, first travel to {z:Dvucca Isle Staging Point} and exit into the Mire.
** Head West to (G-9) and zone into {z:Arrapago Reef}.
** Head North to (H-8) to find the Cutter.
** The {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Caedarva Mire} puts you on the north side of the zone, which is a short run to G-8.
** The {i:Arrapago Ring|Arrapago Ring|26235}, purchased with 100 {p:Imperial standing accolades}, will teleport you in front of the Cutter.
* The battle has a 30 minute time limit.
* Once inside, you will be assaulted by several waves of the Ashu Talif's crew.
** They all have only around 600 {p:HP} each, but can be overwhelming if you don't kill them fast enough.
** Eventually, {m:Swiftwinged Gekko} will appear instead of a wave of crew members.
*** He will appear on the lower deck and then run towards the top deck, where he disappears.
*** He will always attempt to cast one of the following before vanishing: **Bindga**, **Graviga**, **Paralyga**, {p:Sleepga}.
*** He can be {s:stunned|Stun}.
*** If defeated, a second treasure box will spawn when the fight is over.
* After the NM leaves, waves of {m:Watch Imps|Watch Imp} will begin to spawn.
** They primarily cast {p:Ancient Magic}. Their magic can potentially do 550+ damage per cast to a {p:Item Level} 119 character. Additionally, they have a longer casting range than normal and can hit you anywhere on the ship.
* After a few rounds of {m:Watch Imps|Watch Imp}, every one in your party will be given several temporary items to help in the fight.
* Shortly after receiving the temporary items, {m:Swiftwinged Gekko} will appear again.
* Afterwords, you will be fighting waves of Ashu Talif's crew members and {m:Watch Imps|Watch Imp} together.
* {m:Swiftwinged Gekko} will appear randomly inbetween waves.
* The last wave of this assault has {m:Swiftwinged Gekko} appearing with a wave of Crew Members/Imps.
** This is your last chance to finish off {m:Swiftwinged Gekko}.
* Once everything is defeated, the treasure spawns.
** You can exit via the Lifeboat Ramp (where you entered) or by using {i:Cutter Fireflies|Cutter Fireflies|5349} or {p:Warp}.

